# Orchestrator

- LangGraph gated pipeline: intent → config → rate limit → cache → S/4/Hub → LLM → audit.
- Call LLM only via `LLMProvider.complete`.
- Call S/4/Hub via client or thin CPI; support `S4_ACCESS_MODE=hub_direct|cpi`.
- Never put vendor SDK imports in graph node modules — adapters only.
